# Private interview, defense, showcase & resume notes in any subfolder (keep technical SOPs tracked)
# Placed at the bottom after !repro_results/**/*.md so these rules always win
*/**/*[Ii][Nn][Tt][Ee][Rr][Vv][Ii][Ee][Ww]*.md
